# A ghost race's ghost saved to player 1's controller pak (a fresh one), in one run (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2). The
# profile SYN is created (as profile.press), then left for the default player, so the player screen's ready step
# purges its data (PurgePlayerData); back on the player screen SYN is picked, and LoadPlayerData reads it from the
# pak: its name is the cartridge's developer name (cheat_profile_name), which enables the ghost save prompt (gSaveGhostFiles).
# A ghost race (gRace 2) on track 0 backward, the cartridge's lap path: the car (which the cartridge's physics
# crash at once) is respawned every 3.55 s, and each respawn passes a checkpoint, so the three laps end 35.6 s in
# (CarReportsGameOver). Paused and quit there (the race would wait for the car to stop), the results: GhostEnd keeps
# the finished ghost, updateHighScoreScreen compresses it (CompressGhost) and opens the save prompt, whose save item
# writes it (SaveGhost: the note SYNTH049SYN1R.T); then the game over screen. The checks: the pak's two notes and
# the ghost's header, then the next run on the pak, again/ghost2, which races against the ghost.
# until: 0x800000:60
# seconds: 120
# args: --pak ghost.mpk
# expect: state=0x00800000: players 1, windows 1, cars 1, mode 2, track 0
# visits: 0x2000000
# check: tools/port/pak_notes.py ghost.mpk --notes 2 --note SYNTH049SYN.D --ghost SYNTH049SYN1R.T:0:1 --copy-to ghost.first.pak
# check: tools/port/synth_again.py ghost.game.log again/ghost2
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race; the player screen
14 DOWN 0.1    # the pak row
14.5 DOWN 0.1  # create a player
15 A           # the name entry: S Y N, END (as profile.press)
15.5 DOWN 0.1
16 DOWN 0.1
16.5 A
17 RIGHT 0.1
17.3 RIGHT 0.1
17.6 RIGHT 0.1
17.9 RIGHT 0.1
18.2 RIGHT 0.1
18.5 RIGHT 0.1
19 A
19.5 UP 0.1
20 LEFT 0.1
20.3 LEFT 0.1
21 A
22 START       # CreatePlayer; the cursor on SYN
23 UP 0.1      # the pak row
23.5 UP 0.1    # the default player
24 A           # ready: SYN, not picked, is purged; the mode screen
27 B           # back to the player screen
30 DOWN 0.1    # the pak row
30.5 DOWN 0.1  # SYN
31 A           # ready: LoadPlayerData reads SYN from the pak; the mode screen
34 DOWN 0.1    # the ghost race, two modes down
34.3 DOWN 0.1
35 A
37 RIGHT 0.1   # the track select's one option, backward: on
38 A           # track 0
41 A           # the car select; the race from 44 s, the finish at 79.6 s
84 START       # pause
85 UP 0.1      # quit
86 A           # are you sure?
87 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
88 A           # the results; the save prompt from 88 s, on its pak row (pak 1: room for a ghost)
92 DOWN 0.1    # save
94 A           # SaveGhost; the message
97 A           # the records
100 A          # the game over screen
